cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CryoRadar"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-13
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Gümüş"
    given-names: "Mehmet"
url: "https://cyroradar.vercel.app"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SpaceEngineerSS/cyroradar"
abstract: >-
  A browser tool for Mars subsurface radar: SHARAD radargrams from the NASA
  Planetary Data System, simulated MARSIS and SHARAD scenes, time-to-depth
  conversion, bright basal reflection detection with competing hypotheses,
  Monte Carlo uncertainty, migration and an experimental envelope waveform
  inversion.
keywords:
  - Mars
  - radar sounding
  - SHARAD
  - MARSIS
  - subsurface ice
